WEBVTT

01:26.020 --> 01:31.600
[The Ingenious One]

01:33.200 --> 01:39.520
[Episode 16: A Life-and-Death Battle]

01:40.670 --> 01:44.160
Bravo!

01:50.140 --> 01:53.670
Bravo!

02:09.089 --> 02:11.800
[Liansheng House]

02:20.810 --> 02:22.536
Mr. Wu of Wangyue Pavilion.

02:22.560 --> 02:23.926
A pair of golden dice.

02:23.950 --> 02:24.896
Mr. Su.

02:24.920 --> 02:25.710
Mr. Wu.

02:25.710 --> 02:26.550
A little gift for the opening ceremony.

02:26.550 --> 02:28.016
Thank you.

02:28.040 --> 02:29.156
Come in.

02:29.180 --> 02:29.966
Please come in.

02:29.990 --> 02:30.870
Wish you prosperity.

02:30.890 --> 02:32.340
Please come in.

02:33.020 --> 02:34.060
Let's go in and take a look.

02:34.080 --> 02:35.609
Mr. Liu, please come in.

02:36.060 --> 02:37.510
Please come in.

02:37.730 --> 02:39.180
Qian.

02:39.700 --> 02:41.150
Where is my sister?

02:41.770 --> 02:44.806
The deadline for tribute cloth will be due soon.

02:44.830 --> 02:46.406
She is supervising the workers herself.

02:46.430 --> 02:48.440
She can't make it.

02:48.540 --> 02:49.556
She said she would come to see you

02:49.580 --> 02:52.206
with gifts another day.

02:52.230 --> 02:54.460
I understand. The tribute cloth thing is more important.

02:54.710 --> 02:56.310
She's working hard lately.

02:56.390 --> 02:57.956
Please take care of her.

02:57.980 --> 02:59.430
Don't worry.

02:59.780 --> 03:02.130
This will be a busy day.

03:02.190 --> 03:04.760
Take care of yourself.

03:04.980 --> 03:06.530
Then, suit yourself, Qian.

03:09.050 --> 03:10.500
Mr. Liu.

03:10.740 --> 03:12.006
Mr. Liu.

03:12.030 --> 03:12.820
You're quite like

03:12.840 --> 03:15.166
Chairman Su now.

03:15.190 --> 03:16.546
Mr. Liu, it's an honor

03:16.570 --> 03:18.536
to have you here.

03:18.560 --> 03:19.195
Are you satisfied with

03:19.219 --> 03:21.066
the musicians

03:21.090 --> 03:21.866
you hired from me?

03:21.890 --> 03:22.876
Of course.

03:22.900 --> 03:25.470
The musicians at Zhaixing House are all top-notch.

03:26.940 --> 03:28.720
But there was a misunderstanding.

03:28.820 --> 03:29.990
I hope you don't mind.

03:29.990 --> 03:31.626
Misunderstanding? What is it?

03:31.650 --> 03:33.100
Please come in.

04:01.650 --> 04:03.936
Mr. Kang of Guanghui Bank did come to me

04:03.960 --> 04:07.030
for the girl you mentioned just now.

04:07.280 --> 04:08.340
I bought this girl

04:08.360 --> 04:10.686
from the black market.

04:10.710 --> 04:11.846
She's talented.

04:11.870 --> 04:13.286
So, when Mr. Kang

04:13.310 --> 04:15.196
asked to redeem her,

04:15.220 --> 04:17.010
I didn't agree.

04:19.020 --> 04:20.510
But this girl is the daughter of a good friend of mine

04:20.669 --> 04:22.796
who died some time ago.

04:22.820 --> 04:24.346
She got lost.

04:24.370 --> 04:26.106
That's why she was sold into the black market.

04:26.130 --> 04:28.910
I didn't expect her to end up in Zhaixing House.

04:29.790 --> 04:32.916
A few days ago, another friend of mine went to look for her rashly.

04:32.940 --> 04:34.650
I was afraid that he had disturbed you.

04:37.790 --> 04:40.970
She's fine at Zhaixing House.

04:41.330 --> 04:42.939
No one came to look for her.

04:47.470 --> 04:49.216
My brother is a swordsman.

04:49.240 --> 04:51.086
He went to see you with my jade pendant.

04:51.110 --> 04:52.630
You didn't meet him?

04:53.140 --> 04:54.590
No.

05:00.510 --> 05:04.680
Bravo! Bravo! Bravo!

05:20.550 --> 05:21.726
Miao,

05:21.750 --> 05:24.086
change a table for customers of Table Tian.

05:24.110 --> 05:25.590
If they don't want to change,

05:25.590 --> 05:26.686
attend to them.

05:26.710 --> 05:27.886
Keep things in order.

05:27.910 --> 05:29.360
Okay.

05:51.460 --> 05:52.910
Tianhu.

05:54.990 --> 05:57.549
We're so busy today. You should go in and help.

05:57.570 --> 05:59.280
Why are you sitting here and slacking off?

06:00.000 --> 06:01.186
Miss,

06:01.210 --> 06:02.746
I'm just taking a break.

06:02.770 --> 06:04.220
I'll go now.

06:13.860 --> 06:15.310
Mr. Tang.

06:19.590 --> 06:21.266
Let me show you how it's done.

06:21.290 --> 06:21.990
Mr. Tang.

06:21.990 --> 06:23.286
I'll make this place bankrupt

06:23.310 --> 06:25.156
within one day.

06:25.180 --> 06:27.680
Just wait and see. Today is the day.

06:28.610 --> 06:32.280
The present from Mr. Tang of the Tangs' Gambling House is a sword.

06:34.350 --> 06:35.466
Wait.

06:35.490 --> 06:37.250
Yun Xiang.

06:39.690 --> 06:41.140
What?

06:42.160 --> 06:44.566
You aren't letting people in?

06:44.590 --> 06:46.990
Why do you have Jin Biao's sword?

06:47.120 --> 06:49.036
I don't want to talk to you.

06:49.060 --> 06:51.140
Get me Yun Xiang.

06:55.650 --> 06:57.086
Well,

06:57.110 --> 06:59.906
it was I who condoned

06:59.930 --> 07:02.496
Wen Cong opening a gambling house

07:02.520 --> 07:04.356
in Nandu.

07:04.380 --> 07:06.570
But after you came here,

07:06.770 --> 07:09.646
you bought Liansheng House and refreshed it.

07:09.670 --> 07:13.230
Now this place is even better

07:13.230 --> 07:14.696
than Tang's House.

07:14.720 --> 07:16.036
Impressive.

07:16.060 --> 07:18.226
Mr. Tang, I know you are joking.

07:18.250 --> 07:20.380
It's all for the prosperity of Nandu.

07:20.740 --> 07:21.966
We're just doing business.

07:21.990 --> 07:23.506
As an old saying goes,

07:23.530 --> 07:27.136
"There is only one sun in the sky and one king in a country."

07:27.160 --> 07:30.816
By the same logic, we can't have two leaders

07:30.840 --> 07:33.890
in the same industry and in the same region.

07:34.500 --> 07:35.950
Am I right?

07:36.840 --> 07:38.536
Judging from what you said,

07:38.560 --> 07:40.540
you want to battle it out with me?

07:42.270 --> 07:44.660
Let's play.

07:45.930 --> 07:48.236
What's the stake then?

07:48.260 --> 07:49.710
You.

07:50.570 --> 07:52.020
I'm the stake?

07:52.470 --> 07:53.656
If you lose,

07:53.680 --> 07:55.736
write a contract to say

07:55.760 --> 07:57.106
that you volunteer

07:57.130 --> 07:58.896
to become my servant.

07:58.920 --> 07:59.496
Is that okay?

07:59.520 --> 08:00.360
What if I win?

08:00.380 --> 08:01.910
You can't win.

08:07.060 --> 08:08.680
In my opinion,

08:09.090 --> 08:12.426
you are actually a cruel person.

08:12.450 --> 08:14.576
You knew I caught Jin Biao.

08:14.600 --> 08:16.606
You've been chatting for so long.

08:16.630 --> 08:18.006
But you didn't mention anything about him.

08:18.030 --> 08:21.766
You're just like Wen Cong.

08:21.790 --> 08:23.240
Exactly.

08:23.460 --> 08:25.350
Poor Jin Biao.

08:27.010 --> 08:29.160
Before we fight it out,

08:29.380 --> 08:31.130
do you dare to hurt him?

08:31.810 --> 08:33.566
Well, well.

08:33.590 --> 08:35.686
You agreed to gamble with me, right?

08:35.710 --> 08:37.230
I can't wait.

08:38.120 --> 08:39.496
Let me tell you the truth.

08:39.520 --> 08:42.126
The place where my family's servants live

08:42.150 --> 08:45.456
is much more luxurious than the houses of common people.

08:45.480 --> 08:47.780
There are plenty of girls like her.

08:49.490 --> 08:51.560
Do you remember Qi Tianfeng?

08:51.750 --> 08:53.870
What does he have in the end?

08:53.890 --> 08:55.636
Don't compare him to me.

08:55.660 --> 08:58.046
I want it to be big and exciting.

08:58.070 --> 09:00.286
Just decide when and where.

09:00.310 --> 09:02.156
I'm looking forward to it.

09:02.180 --> 09:04.016
You seem to be anxious to gamble with me.

09:04.040 --> 09:04.906
How about this?

09:04.930 --> 09:06.326
Let's do it today.

09:06.350 --> 09:08.590
Now and here.

09:09.330 --> 09:11.266
That's what I think as well.

09:11.290 --> 09:12.406
I'll wait for you downstairs.

09:12.430 --> 09:14.110
Get ready and come down soon.

09:47.500 --> 09:50.550
Tang Xiao only brought Meizhu this time.

09:51.590 --> 09:54.880
That means Zhong should be guarding Jin.

10:05.530 --> 10:08.740
You must keep in mind

10:09.000 --> 10:11.000
you are going to find out whether Jin is safe.

10:11.590 --> 10:13.420
Don't put yourself in danger.

10:15.510 --> 10:16.566
Have you foreseen

10:16.590 --> 10:18.220
the capture of Ten Taels of Gold?

10:22.830 --> 10:24.186
I'm sorry.

10:24.210 --> 10:26.046
I didn't mean it.

10:26.070 --> 10:27.520
It's okay.

10:28.860 --> 10:31.420
Don't worry. I know what to do.

10:34.690 --> 10:36.140
Remember, don't try to

10:36.380 --> 10:38.580
save Jin recklessly.

10:39.120 --> 10:40.606
Protect yourself.

10:40.630 --> 10:42.680
I already have a perfect plan.

10:43.490 --> 10:46.580
You didn't nag when I went out in the past.

10:46.990 --> 10:50.120
In the past? I was single back then.

10:53.020 --> 10:55.620
All right. I can take care of it.

10:55.920 --> 10:57.810
Tang Xiao must be

10:57.930 --> 10:59.590
well prepared.

10:59.840 --> 11:01.290
Don't lose.

11:04.180 --> 11:06.120
If we want it in the bag,

11:06.440 --> 11:08.530
we need the support of something.

11:08.930 --> 11:10.380
What?

11:30.820 --> 11:32.270
Don't move.

12:06.440 --> 12:08.210
You have so many sides.

12:19.570 --> 12:21.260
Defeat Tang Xiao first.

12:36.380 --> 12:38.090
Excuse me.

12:38.700 --> 12:41.766
I heard a big joke just now.

12:41.790 --> 12:44.506
I can't wait to share it with you.

12:44.530 --> 12:46.970
Just now,

12:48.350 --> 12:49.866
someone

12:49.890 --> 12:52.336
wanted to compete with me

12:52.360 --> 12:54.366
on gambling.

12:54.390 --> 12:55.266
Who is this?

12:55.290 --> 12:56.906
Who else can it be?

12:56.930 --> 13:00.456
It's the new owner of Liansheng House,

13:00.480 --> 13:03.800
the arrogant Young Master Xiang.

13:05.100 --> 13:08.590
He's seeking his own destruction.

13:09.670 --> 13:11.410
Destruction?

13:11.710 --> 13:13.110
How come you always

13:13.110 --> 13:14.670
walk without any sound?

13:16.750 --> 13:19.750
Tang Xiao is good at cheating.

13:20.420 --> 13:22.236
By "he",

13:22.260 --> 13:24.936
are you referring to Mr. Yun?

13:24.960 --> 13:26.550
Of course not.

13:26.710 --> 13:29.376
Tang Xiao has been pretentious for so many years.

13:29.400 --> 13:31.276
It's time that someone taught him a lesson.

13:31.300 --> 13:35.526
Since Mr. Yun is your friend,

13:35.550 --> 13:38.740
then he is also a friend of the Su family.

13:40.960 --> 13:43.396
I heard someone else say that before.

13:43.420 --> 13:44.636
Qian,

13:44.660 --> 13:47.036
You've been with Ms. Su for so many years.

13:47.060 --> 13:48.706
Why haven't you learned from her

13:48.730 --> 13:50.370
to be elegant and magnanimous?

14:16.310 --> 14:17.606
Menglan.

14:17.630 --> 14:19.260
It has been a long time.

14:19.320 --> 14:20.770
Behave!

14:25.620 --> 14:27.070
Excuse me.

14:35.120 --> 14:36.770
The contract has been drafted.

14:37.930 --> 14:39.520
Mr. Tang, please have a look.

14:41.970 --> 14:42.980
Let's see.

14:42.050 --> 14:44.090
[Contract]

14:45.060 --> 14:46.836
I guess you all want to know the content.

14:46.860 --> 14:48.340
So, I'll read it.

14:48.660 --> 14:51.530
Today,

14:49.490 --> 15:00.920
[If Tang Xiao wins, I volunteer to be a servant of the Tang family.]

14:49.490 --> 15:00.920
[Today, I agreed to gamble with
Tang Xiao.] [Promiser: Yun Xiang]

14:51.770 --> 14:54.566
I agreed to gamble with Tang Xiao.

14:54.590 --> 14:55.976
If Tang Xiao wins,

14:56.000 --> 14:59.046
I volunteer to be a servant of the Tang family.

14:59.070 --> 15:01.370
Promiser: Yun Xiang.

15:15.520 --> 15:16.846
He used himself as the stake.

15:16.870 --> 15:17.710
How long has it been

15:17.710 --> 15:19.976
since we saw such a big gamble last time?

15:20.000 --> 15:22.126
It's really exciting, isn't it?

15:22.150 --> 15:24.900
Yes, it's going to be interesting this time.

15:36.120 --> 15:37.256
Tang Xiao,

15:37.280 --> 15:38.486
what if you lose?

15:38.510 --> 15:41.236
I've never lost in my whole life.

15:41.260 --> 15:43.486
If you defeat me today,

15:43.510 --> 15:46.470
I'll give you half of

15:46.470 --> 15:48.750
the 17 gambling houses our family owns.

15:49.670 --> 15:50.616
What do you think?

15:50.640 --> 15:53.556
I bet half of my fortune and you bet your freedom.

15:53.580 --> 15:54.976
Is that fair?

15:55.000 --> 15:57.840
I'm afraid you'll lose more than that.

15:58.420 --> 16:00.156
I'm afraid you'll be doomed.

16:00.180 --> 16:03.130
Let's start then.

16:34.480 --> 16:37.630
[Tangs' Gambling House]

16:43.840 --> 16:45.690
Where are you sending the food?

16:48.010 --> 16:49.416
Tell me.

16:49.440 --> 16:50.326
The cellar.

16:50.350 --> 16:51.800
The cellar?

16:52.310 --> 16:53.636
Is a swordsman kept there?

16:53.660 --> 16:55.110
Yes.

17:01.190 --> 17:02.640
Go.

17:08.580 --> 17:10.030
Hurry up.

17:12.120 --> 17:13.016
Where is he?

17:13.040 --> 17:14.830
Up there.

17:29.150 --> 17:30.860
He's here again.

17:36.800 --> 17:38.250
Open the door!

17:47.900 --> 17:49.730
You deserve it.

17:52.460 --> 17:53.786
There's no guard outside.

17:53.810 --> 17:55.260
Run!

18:05.300 --> 18:07.916
They were roofied by Master.

18:07.940 --> 18:10.030
They've long lost their mind.

18:10.490 --> 18:12.740
They've been tortured.

18:13.280 --> 18:14.616
Miss.

18:14.640 --> 18:16.636
Miss, please kill us.

18:16.660 --> 18:18.586
We want to die but we are not able to.

18:18.610 --> 18:19.150
Miss.

18:19.170 --> 18:21.680
What are you talking about? Run!

18:21.770 --> 18:23.250
We can't get out.

18:24.110 --> 18:26.230
Master has foretold my fate.

18:26.590 --> 18:28.480
We are destined

18:29.050 --> 18:32.090
to be his slaves.

18:32.580 --> 18:34.830
I've given you options. It's up to you.

19:21.030 --> 19:22.480
Jin.

19:38.040 --> 19:40.566
How do you want to play this round?

19:40.590 --> 19:43.240
Since we're playing, we should play hard.

19:43.550 --> 19:45.766
How about this? Three rounds in total.

19:45.790 --> 19:47.710
How about two out of three?

19:48.420 --> 19:49.880
You are the guest. You decide.

19:51.000 --> 19:52.426
Since you've decided how many rounds there should be,

19:52.450 --> 19:54.246
according to the rules,

19:54.270 --> 19:56.016
we should decide what to play.

19:56.040 --> 19:57.726
Mr. Su,

19:57.750 --> 20:01.460
you sound like a jerk.

20:01.670 --> 20:03.516
I'm the guest.

20:03.540 --> 20:05.670
I use all your stuff.

20:05.690 --> 20:09.196
I should decide what to play as well.

20:09.220 --> 20:10.176
Menglan.

20:10.200 --> 20:12.030
Isn't that right?

20:16.950 --> 20:18.400
You...

20:18.650 --> 20:20.100
It doesn't matter.

20:20.180 --> 20:22.170
Just do as Mr. Tang said.

20:22.300 --> 20:23.750
Learn from him.

20:23.830 --> 20:26.170
Mr. Tang, please.

20:26.600 --> 20:28.230
What should we play?

20:32.110 --> 20:33.560
Cui,

20:34.020 --> 20:36.966
how old are you?

20:36.990 --> 20:38.986
I'm 17.

20:39.010 --> 20:40.490
In this round,

20:40.800 --> 20:43.610
let's bet on whether this girl

20:43.750 --> 20:46.480
can live to 18.

20:48.570 --> 20:50.020
Young Master.

20:51.670 --> 20:53.926
- Young Master, please spare my life.
- Tang Xiao is too unruly.

20:53.950 --> 20:56.830
He's always like this. There's nothing he doesn't dare to do.

21:02.890 --> 21:05.510
Mr. Tang, you must be joking.

21:06.220 --> 21:07.126
No.

21:07.150 --> 21:08.326
I am

21:08.350 --> 21:11.470
being serious.

21:12.360 --> 21:14.460
Just make a guess.

21:14.480 --> 21:16.200
Please spare my life.

21:16.360 --> 21:17.940
I want to see

21:18.470 --> 21:20.840
how Yun Xiang is going to solve the dilemma.

21:26.720 --> 21:28.600
Please spare my life.

21:28.890 --> 21:31.566
If we guess she can live past 18,

21:31.590 --> 21:33.366
are you really going to kill her on the spot?

21:33.390 --> 21:35.766
You already have Menglan,

21:35.790 --> 21:37.760
who's such a beauty.

21:38.140 --> 21:40.586
Don't covet my girl.

21:40.610 --> 21:43.190
It's none of your business.

21:43.270 --> 21:45.226
What can I do?

21:45.250 --> 21:47.770
What can I do to her?

21:48.510 --> 21:51.060
For a flower-like girl like her,

21:51.420 --> 21:54.556
a disease or an accident

21:54.580 --> 21:56.480
can destroy her easily.

21:57.470 --> 21:58.920
What do you think?

22:01.220 --> 22:03.750
Mr. Tang is indeed bold.

22:04.800 --> 22:08.310
I throw in the towel in this round.

22:15.550 --> 22:16.686
No.

22:16.710 --> 22:18.650
That's too hasty.

22:18.830 --> 22:19.806
You...

22:19.830 --> 22:22.490
You're just trying to be the bigger man.

22:22.730 --> 22:25.600
Even if you admitted defeat, you need to play by the rules.

22:26.470 --> 22:27.930
Yun Xiang,

22:27.960 --> 22:29.886
I'll ask you again.

22:29.910 --> 22:32.146
And you need to answer me again.

22:32.170 --> 22:36.310
Can she live to age 18?

22:44.680 --> 22:48.730
I think she's haunted by evil energy.

22:49.780 --> 22:51.230
She's been suffering.

22:52.290 --> 22:53.970
I don't think she'll survive to 18.

23:00.800 --> 23:02.430
Nonsense!

23:02.800 --> 23:04.646
She works for the Tang family.

23:04.670 --> 23:07.436
I'll treat her well.

23:07.460 --> 23:08.836
18?

23:08.860 --> 23:10.236
If I want her to live past 80,

23:10.260 --> 23:12.820
she wouldn't dare to die at 70.

23:13.430 --> 23:15.610
Look at you. I was just kidding.

23:16.830 --> 23:17.746
Stand up.

23:17.770 --> 23:19.860
How rude.

23:20.030 --> 23:20.996
Here.

23:21.020 --> 23:24.566
Thank Mr. Yun for saving my life.

23:24.590 --> 23:25.396
Thank you, Mr. Yun.

23:25.420 --> 23:26.870
Move aside!

23:30.830 --> 23:32.006
Yun Xiang.

23:32.030 --> 23:33.480
Three rounds in total.

23:33.780 --> 23:36.370
I've won the first round.

23:37.250 --> 23:38.770
Winning you in this way

23:38.870 --> 23:40.610
is fair, isn't it?

23:42.510 --> 23:45.030
It's all about flexible strategies and tactics.

23:46.820 --> 23:50.386
Mr. Tang, you really excel at this.

23:50.410 --> 23:54.050
I'm impressed.

23:54.220 --> 23:56.446
Mr. Tang, you are on our turf now.

23:56.470 --> 23:58.890
You must be worried about using our stuff.

24:05.110 --> 24:06.560
It doesn't matter.

24:07.110 --> 24:08.226
If you want to cheat, make sure I can't tell.

24:08.250 --> 24:11.230
As long as you can do that, you win.

24:11.740 --> 24:12.956
Fine.

24:12.980 --> 24:14.846
You seem very confident.

24:14.870 --> 24:16.670
I don't want to make things too complicated.

24:17.010 --> 24:19.676
Let's play something easy.

24:19.700 --> 24:21.270
Let's have a game of luck.

24:21.730 --> 24:23.180
How about word guessing?

24:23.510 --> 24:25.180
Word guessing?

24:25.670 --> 24:27.360
The easier kind or the more difficult one?

24:27.800 --> 24:29.250
Let's take the easier form.

24:29.350 --> 24:30.726
It's the simplest

24:30.750 --> 24:32.256
but the most interesting.

24:32.280 --> 24:33.946
The easy-level word guessing?

24:33.970 --> 24:35.326
What is it?

24:35.350 --> 24:37.270
You don't know?

24:37.420 --> 24:39.726
Even a kid can play that.

24:39.750 --> 24:41.200
Really?

24:42.190 --> 24:43.710
You play instead of me then.

24:43.800 --> 24:46.540
No, no, no. Mr. Tang, it should be you.

24:48.150 --> 24:49.600
Word guessing it is.

24:49.860 --> 24:51.556
I think you believe no one

24:51.580 --> 24:53.300
here in Liansheng House.

24:53.790 --> 24:55.240
How about this?

24:55.350 --> 24:57.170
You can write the word yourself.

24:57.450 --> 25:00.440
Choose one from spring, summer, autumn, and winter.

25:00.790 --> 25:02.490
If I guess right, I win.

25:06.010 --> 25:08.226
One word out of four.

25:08.250 --> 25:10.106
Then before this game starts,

25:10.130 --> 25:12.126
I already have a 75% chance of winning.

25:12.150 --> 25:13.456
Before we know the outcome,

25:13.480 --> 25:15.800
it doesn't matter even if you have a 90% chance.

25:16.540 --> 25:17.990
How confident you are.

25:37.620 --> 25:38.306
Tang Xiao,

25:38.330 --> 25:39.866
don't go too far.

25:39.890 --> 25:41.440
Have I gone too far?

25:48.510 --> 25:50.330
It doesn't matter, Mr. Su.

25:51.030 --> 25:51.726
He's worried that

25:51.750 --> 25:54.246
we would tamper with the paper and ink.

25:54.270 --> 25:55.860
It's reasonable.

25:56.590 --> 25:58.040
Learn from him.

26:00.300 --> 26:02.620
I want to use the paper and ink from your accounting office.

26:02.760 --> 26:03.756
Pretty,

26:03.780 --> 26:05.230
please get those for me.

26:07.420 --> 26:08.870
Tianhu.

26:12.030 --> 26:13.710
Mr. Yun hasn't agreed.

26:15.120 --> 26:16.570
Go ahead.

26:19.660 --> 26:20.686
Meizhu.

26:20.710 --> 26:22.166
Go with her.

26:22.190 --> 26:24.080
She looks dull,

26:24.520 --> 26:26.560
but she's very cunning.

26:56.250 --> 26:57.700
Jin.

27:19.750 --> 27:21.200
Drunken Dragon!

27:53.020 --> 27:54.470
Run!

27:55.160 --> 27:56.690
Yanan, run!

28:19.460 --> 28:22.020
She's not poisoned?

28:56.660 --> 28:58.250
Master wants paper.

29:05.340 --> 29:06.790
Are these clean?

29:14.070 --> 29:16.770
Mr. Yun doesn't want that innocent maid

29:17.380 --> 29:18.816
to die on the spot.

29:18.840 --> 29:20.670
So, he lost the first round.

29:21.110 --> 29:23.096
The second round is crucial.

29:23.120 --> 29:25.660
Why is he still so careless?

29:26.170 --> 29:29.276
It's very likely that he'll cheat.

29:29.300 --> 29:32.276
How can he cheat at word guessing?

29:32.300 --> 29:32.670
He...

29:32.690 --> 29:34.360
You don't know him well.

29:34.720 --> 29:36.596
He looks calm,

29:36.620 --> 29:38.520
making you anxious.

29:38.610 --> 29:41.300
In fact, he has been fully prepared.

29:51.600 --> 29:53.686
This scene

29:53.710 --> 29:57.890
reminds me of the poet, Li Bai.

29:58.260 --> 30:01.046
He once ordered senior officials

30:01.070 --> 30:03.010
to remove his boots and prepare ink for him.

30:03.250 --> 30:06.036
I also want to have a try.

30:06.060 --> 30:07.846
If I take off the boots, it will be smelly.

30:07.870 --> 30:08.976
Right?

30:09.000 --> 30:10.490
Then just grind the inkstick for me.

30:10.750 --> 30:12.486
What do you think, Mr. Su?

30:12.510 --> 30:14.096
Will you

30:14.120 --> 30:15.590
do that?

30:17.150 --> 30:19.566
How dare you compare yourself to Li Bai?

30:19.590 --> 30:21.406
If you don't want to,

30:21.430 --> 30:23.100
then let the beauty do it.

30:24.740 --> 30:26.190
I'll do it.

30:56.320 --> 30:58.480
I must find a chance

30:59.150 --> 31:01.376
to teach Tang Xiao a lesson.

31:01.400 --> 31:02.806
Qian,

31:02.830 --> 31:05.046
you've been through all kinds of hardships.

31:05.070 --> 31:07.566
Why can't you keep calm when things involve the Su family?

31:07.590 --> 31:09.716
Don't worry. The evil will be punished.

31:09.740 --> 31:11.810
He'll kick Tang Xiao's ass for you.

31:12.460 --> 31:14.380
Mr. Mo. Mr. Qian.

31:16.940 --> 31:18.390
Which round is it?

31:18.680 --> 31:20.130
Round two.

31:20.230 --> 31:21.656
Yun Xiang lost the first round.

31:21.680 --> 31:23.550
We'll see the outcome of this round soon.

31:25.990 --> 31:28.510
Why is Mr. Su serving Tang Xiao?

31:28.750 --> 31:31.196
Tang Xiao has always been disorderly.

31:31.220 --> 31:34.340
He's just trying to humiliate Mr. Su.

31:42.240 --> 31:43.626
Then,

31:43.650 --> 31:45.880
Mr. Su is better than Tang Xiao.

31:47.190 --> 31:50.020
What do you mean, Miss Shu?

31:50.650 --> 31:52.506
Mr. Su has been living a luxurious life.

31:52.530 --> 31:54.070
He doesn't know how difficult normal people's life is.

31:54.740 --> 31:56.096
After experiencing this,

31:56.120 --> 31:58.696
he'll know compromise and endurance are fine.

31:58.720 --> 32:01.030
He'll be more broad-minded.

32:09.230 --> 32:10.680
Please.

32:13.150 --> 32:14.690
Am I that pretty?

32:15.050 --> 32:17.126
Don't you know you should recuse?

32:17.150 --> 32:18.310
You can't just say my word out loud

32:18.330 --> 32:20.660
after I finish writing, can you?

32:42.580 --> 32:44.390
You. Come here.

32:45.000 --> 32:47.296
You're kind of chubby.

32:47.320 --> 32:49.310
Go up and block their view.

32:53.210 --> 32:54.990
Be quiet.

33:08.710 --> 33:10.160
Okay.

33:10.780 --> 33:12.230
Go away.

33:20.300 --> 33:21.750
You can guess now.

33:27.540 --> 33:28.686
Guess.

33:28.710 --> 33:30.550
Mr. Tang, calm down.

33:31.260 --> 33:32.720
Let me think about it.

33:33.840 --> 33:37.030
You made the rule yourself.

33:40.240 --> 33:41.690
Take your time.

33:43.120 --> 33:45.200
Beauty, come on.

33:46.280 --> 33:49.230
Wait there to open the box anytime.

33:54.270 --> 33:55.976
This round is crucial.

33:56.000 --> 33:57.346
If Young Master Xiang loses again,

33:57.370 --> 34:00.200
he'll become a servant in the Tang family.

34:27.180 --> 34:28.630
That's not right.

34:28.710 --> 34:30.496
He has always been decisive.

34:30.520 --> 34:32.320
Why is he hesitant suddenly?

34:32.790 --> 34:34.806
He chose to play word guessing himself.

34:34.830 --> 34:37.130
I'm worried that he would fail

34:37.260 --> 34:39.240
if he planned poorly.

34:40.129 --> 34:41.216
Girl.

34:41.240 --> 34:42.636
This is the second round.

34:42.660 --> 34:43.646
He lost the first round.

34:43.670 --> 34:44.355
If he loses again,

34:44.379 --> 34:46.080
he will be Tang Xiao's servant.

34:47.029 --> 34:48.479
Don't worry.

34:48.859 --> 34:50.459
He will surely win.

34:53.379 --> 34:54.246
Mr. Mo,

34:54.270 --> 34:55.936
I have a private request.

34:55.960 --> 34:57.770
May I have a word with you?

35:06.270 --> 35:08.100
I was just thinking about this.

35:08.160 --> 35:09.846
Yun Xiang is betting his freedom on this

35:09.870 --> 35:12.206
but you and Jin Biao were not here.

35:12.230 --> 35:14.140
Jin Biao was captured. That's why.

35:14.180 --> 35:15.586
But I was careless.

35:15.610 --> 35:17.410
I failed to save him.

35:17.940 --> 35:19.196
It's not your fault.

35:19.220 --> 35:21.570
It's right to escape first in that situation.

35:28.240 --> 35:29.690
Drunken Dragon?

35:31.740 --> 35:33.830
You were poisoned by Drunken Dragon.

35:36.270 --> 35:37.890
How did you manage to escape?

35:40.330 --> 35:42.196
Why are you like Yun Xiang?

35:42.220 --> 35:44.150
You both suspect your own people first.

35:44.500 --> 35:46.710
Why are you like Yun Xiang?

35:46.950 --> 35:48.980
You both borrow shadowmen from me when you need help.

35:51.470 --> 35:53.956
Tang Xiao once brought people to Liansheng House to cause trouble.

35:53.980 --> 35:55.946
I was almost injured by poisonous needles.

35:55.970 --> 35:58.166
That's how I know he's a master of poison.

35:58.190 --> 36:01.050
Therefore, I was fully prepared when I went to rescue Jin.

36:01.200 --> 36:03.566
The medicine I brought couldn't detoxify the poison immediately,

36:03.590 --> 36:05.316
but it could delay the effect of the poison

36:05.340 --> 36:08.100
so that I could have enough energy to escape from Tang's Residence.

36:14.430 --> 36:15.786
I'm just curious.

36:15.810 --> 36:17.570
I didn't suspect you.

36:18.150 --> 36:19.496
How about this?

36:19.520 --> 36:21.076
I'll ask shadowmen to keep an eye on Tang's Residence.

36:21.100 --> 36:22.270
If Jin Biao is transferred,

36:22.290 --> 36:24.526
we'll know.

36:24.550 --> 36:26.770
That's enough. Thank you, Mr. Mo.

36:39.910 --> 36:41.906
Yun Xiang.

36:41.930 --> 36:45.396
It's about sunset. Give your answer quickly.

36:45.420 --> 36:48.300
Why don't you just go back to Tang's Residence with me?

36:49.370 --> 36:51.160
I will definitely go to Tang's Residence.

36:51.710 --> 36:53.170
But not now.

36:53.310 --> 36:56.370
You are dragging your feet.

36:56.670 --> 36:58.120
Yun.

36:58.960 --> 37:02.170
I'm back. Are you more eased?

37:04.910 --> 37:06.550
I feel more than that.

37:07.070 --> 37:08.580
Upon your return,

37:08.820 --> 37:10.570
I suddenly had an idea.

37:19.170 --> 37:20.620
I've made up my mind.

37:21.380 --> 37:23.100
Have you?

37:24.060 --> 37:25.890
Think it through.

37:26.190 --> 37:28.180
You only have one chance.

37:39.190 --> 37:42.340
"Snowflakes are just like petals of pear flowers."

37:43.930 --> 37:47.540
"In the heavy snow, I can barely see the village."

37:49.430 --> 37:53.120
The world turns quiet when heavy snow falls.

37:54.460 --> 37:55.910
I choose winter.

37:58.600 --> 38:00.210
Manager Ke, please reveal the answer.

38:26.310 --> 38:29.990
[Winter]

38:28.550 --> 38:29.766
It's really winter.

38:29.790 --> 38:31.770
He guessed right.

38:33.230 --> 38:34.456
That's unexpected.

38:34.480 --> 38:37.210
Tang Xiao was defeated.

38:45.980 --> 38:48.980
You cheated.

38:49.610 --> 38:51.060
Tang Xiao.

38:51.120 --> 38:52.596
If you can tell me,

38:52.620 --> 38:53.996
how I won,

38:54.020 --> 38:55.470
I can make you the winner of this round.

39:12.410 --> 39:15.096
I've seen so many eyes.

39:15.120 --> 39:16.906
Yours are the most beautiful.

39:16.930 --> 39:19.650
If you keep staring at me with them,

39:19.790 --> 39:22.370
I'll take them home without you.

39:30.660 --> 39:32.260
Did you cheat?

39:33.470 --> 39:34.920
Maybe.

39:35.780 --> 39:37.230
Maybe not.

39:38.250 --> 39:39.800
Round three.

39:40.190 --> 39:42.700
I can decide how to play this round, right?

39:47.170 --> 39:48.376
We've finished two rounds

39:48.400 --> 39:50.360
so quickly.

39:50.970 --> 39:53.910
Mr. Tang, you think it's not fun enough, don't you?

39:55.560 --> 39:57.310
What do you mean?

39:58.390 --> 39:59.840
I'm thinking

39:59.930 --> 40:01.406
how about making this bigger?

40:01.430 --> 40:04.470
I'm listening. I'm afraid you can't make it big enough.

40:06.500 --> 40:07.786
Let's see

40:07.810 --> 40:09.260
if Liansheng House can make more revenues

40:10.120 --> 40:12.100
than Tang's House

40:12.750 --> 40:15.440
in the next three days.

40:22.780 --> 40:24.230
Okay.
